---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { site } from '@/data/site'
import { platforms } from '@/data/platforms'
import TrustNav from '@/components/TrustNav.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate disclosure"
  description="How this site makes money, which programmes we participate in, and the rules we hold ourselves to when a commercial link sits next to a recommendation."
  path="/disclosure"
>
  <section class="page-masthead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Trust</span>
      <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <TrustNav current="disclosure" />

  <section class="wrap measure" style="padding-block:48px 64px;">
    <div class="callout">
      <strong>The short version</strong>
      Some links on {site.name} are affiliate links. If you open an account through one, the
      operator may pay us a commission. It does not change the price you pay, and it does not
      change a score — our rubric is published and applied before any commercial relationship exists.
    </div>

    <h2>Programmes we participate in</h2>
    <p>
      We apply to affiliate programmes after a platform has been reviewed, not before. A platform
      that declines to work with us keeps its score; a platform that pays more does not gain one.
    </p>
    <ul>
      {platforms.map((p) => (
        <li>
          <strong>{p.name}</strong> — {p.affiliateUrl ? 'approved, tracked links in use' : 'application pending; no tracked link is live on this site yet'}
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <h2>How links are marked</h2>
    <p>
      Every outbound commercial link carries <code>rel="sponsored nofollow"</code>. Links inside
      editorial body text that are not commercial are left as ordinary links. If you find a
      commercial link that is not marked, that is a bug — please report it.
    </p>

    <h2>What we will not do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Publish a "guaranteed profit" or "risk-free" claim about any betting product.</li>
      <li>Hide the fact that most retail bettors lose money over time.</li>
      <li>Rank a platform higher because it pays a higher commission.</li>
      <li>Run a review of a platform we have no way to verify.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Risk warning</h2>
    <p>
      Prediction markets and sports betting are not investments. Staking money on an outcome can
      lose the entire stake. Nothing on this site is financial, legal or tax advice, and nothing
      here is a recommendation to bet. See <a href="/responsible-gambling">responsible gambling</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
